<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ cuts NZ floating mortgage rate to 10.65 pct.</title>
<headline>ANZ cuts NZ floating mortgage rate to 10.65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Banking Group (New Zealand) Ltd and its Postbank unit said on Thursday they had cut their New Zealand variable mortgage interest rate to 10.65 percent from 11.50 percent.</p>
<p>The new rates are effective for new applications from November 4 and for existing customers from December 5.</p>
<p>ANZ said the cuts followed recent falls in wholesale rates.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
